sentences.l:
as he speaks, of the gods the lofty house falls silent,
and, made to tremble from its base, the earth; silent is the steep aether;
then the Zephyrs lay down; presses its waters calm the sea:

sentences.t:
vel quale per artem
inclusum buxo aut Oricia terebintho
lucet ebur;

sentences.l:
or as, by art
enclosed in boxwood or Orician terebinth,
shines ivory;

Present too was Mnestheus, whom, of Turnus driven back, the recent
from the rampart of the walls, on high the glory lifts,
and Capys:
